 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【法国公布世界杯名单】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-15/6a05007a2bec7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">法国世界杯26人名单：姆巴佩、登贝莱、奥利塞在列，卡马文加落选</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150312048597_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150312048597_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150312048597_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">北京时间5月15日凌晨2点，法国队官方公布了参加本届美加墨世界杯的26人最终名单。姆巴佩、登贝莱、奥利塞、坎特、拉克鲁瓦、马特塔在列，卡马文加、穆阿尼落选。埃基蒂克4月份遭遇跟腱断裂，无缘本届世界杯。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-15/6a0618124655anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">德尚：卡马文加出场不足且受伤病困扰 有六七队具备争冠实力</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-15/6a06246ca7b2enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">德尚：登贝莱啥位置？守门！他是金球先生，和巴黎简直在惩罚对手</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150337456399_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150337456399_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150337456399_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">法国主帅德尚在宣布法国队世界杯阵容后解释了自己的选择，随后他又出席新闻发布会，接受媒体提问谈及自己的阵容选择。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-15/6a0609e6da962native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">回顾法国上届世界杯名单：格子、瓦拉内、吉鲁、穆阿尼...</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_221220/63a0de9ee4f6f.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_221220/63a0de9ee4f6f.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_221220/63a0de9ee4f6f.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">与法国参加2022年卡塔尔世界杯名单相对比，法国队在各个位置上都发生了人员变化。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-15/6a0615a799329native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">领衔法国队世界杯名单！姆巴佩：感到无比自豪 努力不让你们失望</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.74" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150234422309.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.74" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.74" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150234422309_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150234422309_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">法国队公布世界杯26人名单，姆巴佩入选。随后他更新了个人社媒。</span></p><p><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">【比赛战报】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-15/match1730691date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">皇马2-0奥维耶多 贡萨洛贝林厄姆破门姆巴佩被嘘+送助攻</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260515/zhanbao_image_1730691_1778793315_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260515/zhanbao_image_1730691_1778793315_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260515/zhanbao_image_1730691_1778793315_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">姆巴佩助攻贝林厄姆替补建功。最终皇马2-0奥维耶多。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-15/6a062b74a4ccanative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">3年2冠！青年足总杯决赛曼城2-1绝杀曼联，瓜帅、卡里克现场观战</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150407271037.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150407271037_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150407271037_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">青年足总杯决赛，曼城青年队2-1战胜曼联青年队夺冠，瓜迪奥拉、卡里克和福登现场观战。</span></p><p><strong>【赛后声音】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-15/6a06425f8bf91native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">要爆！姆巴佩：替补是因为被排成第四前锋 俱乐部同意我才去度假</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-15/6a064d75359c4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">还有第二集！姆巴佩：我错就错在没拿冠军 主帅回应？不看发布会</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150550152917.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150550152917_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150550152917_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">西甲第36轮，皇马2-0皇家奥维耶多。赛后，姆巴佩来到混合采访区接受采访，发表许多言论针对近期风波给予了回应。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-15/6a0644ec53e59native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿韦洛亚回应姆巴佩：没说他是第四前锋 我是主帅谁首发由我决定</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.01" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150556227747.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.01" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.01" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150556227747.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150556227747.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">皇马2-0战胜奥维耶多，</span><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-15/6a06425f8bf91native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">姆巴佩赛后表示，自己被主教练告知只是第四前锋</a><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">，阿韦洛亚则进行了否认。</span></p><p><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">【其他新闻】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-15/6a05f8151162bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">届时安帅将七十岁！官方：巴西国家队和66岁安切洛蒂续约至2030年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.47" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150028569171.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.47" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.47" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150028569171_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260515/202605150028569171_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">巴西足协官方消息，66岁主帅安切洛蒂与巴西队续约至2030年。合同期满时安切洛蒂将年满70岁。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-14/6a05e3b67f961native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">重返皇马！马卡：皇马通知恩德里克，他将进入下赛季一线队名单</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260112/6964c7cba2810.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260112/6964c7cba2810.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260112/6964c7cba2810.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">《马卡报》报道，恩德里克即将结束他在法甲里昂的租借生涯，并在下周正式重返皇马。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-14/6a05ef70b4da5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">开天价年薪！全市场：新月想签莱万，计划开出9000万欧年薪</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duo